{"id":"99f4e6abf02e07ae","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-language.md","title":"Formal Language","display":"df-language — Formal Language","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-language","aliases":["88-df-language"],"display":"df-language — Formal Language","depends_on":["[[88-df-symbol]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-language"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-language — Formal Language"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0f1e525f3e037509\" href=\"?note=0f1e525f3e037509\" title=\"88-df-symbol\">88-df-symbol</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-language-—-First-Order-Signature-$S$\">df-language — First-Order Signature <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Const}_S,\\mathrm{Func}_S^n,\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\">\\(\\mathrm{Const}_S,\\mathrm{Func}_S^n,\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\)</span> (signature components, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0f1e525f3e037509\" href=\"?note=0f1e525f3e037509\" title=\"88-df-symbol\">88-df-symbol</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LogSym},\\mathrm{NLSym}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LogSym},\\mathrm{NLSym}_S\\)</span> (logical and nonlogical symbol sets, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0f1e525f3e037509\" href=\"?note=0f1e525f3e037509\" title=\"88-df-symbol\">88-df-symbol</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Language}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Language}(S)\\)</span> (first-order-signature predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}language} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Language}(S)\n\\leftrightarrow\nS=\\left\\langle\n\\mathrm{Const}_S,\n(\\mathrm{Func}_S^n)_{n\\geq1},\n(\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n)_{n\\geq1}\n\\right\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{LogSym}\\cap\\mathrm{NLSym}_S=\\emptyset\n\\land\\forall m,n\\geq1\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Const}_S\\cap\\mathrm{Func}_S^n=\\emptyset\n\\land\\mathrm{Const}_S\\cap\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n=\\emptyset\n\\land\\mathrm{Func}_S^m\\cap\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n=\\emptyset\n\\land(m\\neq n\\to\\mathrm{Func}_S^m\\cap\\mathrm{Func}_S^n=\\emptyset)\n\\land(m\\neq n\\to\\mathrm{Rel}_S^m\\cap\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n=\\emptyset)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}language} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Language}(S)\n\\leftrightarrow\nS=\\left\\langle\n\\mathrm{Const}_S,\n(\\mathrm{Func}_S^n)_{n\\geq1},\n(\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n)_{n\\geq1}\n\\right\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{LogSym}\\cap\\mathrm{NLSym}_S=\\emptyset\n\\land\\forall m,n\\geq1\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Const}_S\\cap\\mathrm{Func}_S^n=\\emptyset\n\\land\\mathrm{Const}_S\\cap\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n=\\emptyset\n\\land\\mathrm{Func}_S^m\\cap\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n=\\emptyset\n\\land(m\\neq n\\to\\mathrm{Func}_S^m\\cap\\mathrm{Func}_S^n=\\emptyset)\n\\land(m\\neq n\\to\\mathrm{Rel}_S^m\\cap\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n=\\emptyset)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>本书模型论与算术语法中的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>表示一阶签名，而不是任意字符串语言</li>\n<li>全部角色与不同元数的分量两两互斥，所以每个非逻辑符号的角色和\n元数都由<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>唯一确定</li>\n</ul>\n<p>相关概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0f1e525f3e037509\" href=\"?note=0f1e525f3e037509\" title=\"88-df-symbol\">88-df-symbol</a>：签名中的逻辑与非逻辑符号</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a>：语言中的合式表达式</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a6c52aed1a56207b\" href=\"?note=a6c52aed1a56207b\" title=\"88-df-decidable-set\">88-df-decidable-set</a>：自然数集合的可判定性（与这里的“一阶签名”不同）</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-language-—-First-Order-Signature-$S$","text":"df-language — First-Order Signature $S$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-symbol","status":"resolved","id":"0f1e525f3e037509","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-symbol]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-symbol","status":"resolved","id":"0f1e525f3e037509","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Const}_S,\\mathrm{Func}_S^n,\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n$ (signature components, see [[88-df-symbol]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-symbol","status":"resolved","id":"0f1e525f3e037509","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LogSym},\\mathrm{NLSym}_S$ (logical and nonlogical symbol sets, see [[88-df-symbol]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-symbol","status":"resolved","id":"0f1e525f3e037509","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[88-df-symbol]]：签名中的逻辑与非逻辑符号","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e14624569ca2194b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[88-df-formula]]：语言中的合式表达式","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"a6c52aed1a56207b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[88-df-decidable-set]]：自然数集合的可判定性（与这里的“一阶签名”不同）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Const}_S,\\mathrm{Func}_S^n,\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LogSym},\\mathrm{NLSym}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Language}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}language} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Language}(S)\n\\leftrightarrow\nS=\\left\\langle\n\\mathrm{Const}_S,\n(\\mathrm{Func}_S^n)_{n\\geq1},\n(\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n)_{n\\geq1}\n\\right\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{LogSym}\\cap\\mathrm{NLSym}_S=\\emptyset\n\\land\\forall m,n\\geq1\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Const}_S\\cap\\mathrm{Func}_S^n=\\emptyset\n\\land\\mathrm{Const}_S\\cap\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n=\\emptyset\n\\land\\mathrm{Func}_S^m\\cap\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n=\\emptyset\n\\land(m\\neq n\\to\\mathrm{Func}_S^m\\cap\\mathrm{Func}_S^n=\\emptyset)\n\\land(m\\neq n\\to\\mathrm{Rel}_S^m\\cap\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n=\\emptyset)\n\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false}],"bytes":1565,"backlinks":[{"id":"1ac75150a2814e24","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-df-language]]：由字母表构造的表达式集合"},{"id":"0084b7b825c6c2d7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}$ (arithmetic signature, see [[88-df-language]])"},{"id":"0aa80b611d62ec1b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"03af5095ed087251","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"本文件是**逐公式的定义模式**。$L$ 是背景一阶理论的签名，$\\mathrm{Language}(L)$ 见 [[88-df-language]]；该理论含有指定默认对象的常量项 $c_0$。本册元数学使用 ZFC，默认对象取 $\\emptyset$。"},{"id":"69c0e9e2e8f423a6","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Language}(S)$ 使用 [[88-df-language]] 的一元一阶签名谓词。"},{"id":"111244cddc854123","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0183981e6c8952fc","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Language}(S)$，见 [[88-df-language]]。"},{"id":"3f44d69945b890a4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"da378